    ex:birth "\"",
        "\"Oropher had come among them [the Elves of the Greenwood] with only a handful of Sindar",
        "Before {{FA|507}} or early {{SA}}<Ref group=note name=Birth>Thranduil's birth is unknown",
        "Thranduil must have had his origins in Doriath prior to its ruin or somewhere in Middle-earth in the early Second Age.</ref>",
        "Thranduil was one of the Sindar who made the journey",
        "but some things can be deduced from two passages in ''Unfinished Tales'' taken together: \"Before the building of the Barad-dûr many of the Sindar passed eastward",
        "king in the north of Greenwood the Great",
        "some established realms in the forests [...] Thranduil",
        "they [...] came from Doriath after its ruin.\" Since Oropher's Sindar journeyed east from Doriath after its ruin",
        "was one of these" ;
